        "notes": "A record whose items are invalid, or any line that is not a whole review or decision, is skipped and counted (warning on stderr; --open exits 1). Records without items are legacy. openFindings counts every item of every structured review over a target, once per (review, item), decisions unioned across the target's commits; stale reviews are labelled, never dropped; a clean re-run clears nothing. copyReviews (adopt, carry, wip re-snapshot) copies review lines raw, unreadable ones included, so the gate cannot be bypassed by copying; staleness is computed per review (reviewStale)."
